PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE READ_ONLY
OP C SOURCE prior.scope
OP R SOURCE prior.ref
OP M SOURCE prior.memory_ref
OP I SOURCE prior.index
OP N SOURCE prior.count
OP EC SOURCE event.scope
OP ER SOURCE event.previous_ref
OP EM SOURCE event.memory_before
OP EN SOURCE event.memory_after
OP EI SOURCE event.index_before
OP EJ SOURCE event.index_after
OP E SOURCE event.ref
OP V SOURCE event.verified
OP P SOURCE event.phase
OP B SOURCE event.orbit_before
OP A SOURCE event.orbit_after
OP T SOURCE event.time
OP G SOURCE event.parity
OP W SOURCE event.work
OP CM IDENTITY C EC
OP RM IDENTITY R ER
OP MM IDENTITY M EM
OP IM IDENTITY I EI
OP COUNT DIFFERENCE N -1
OP ENTRY COMPOSITION R E C M EN V P B A T I EJ G W COUNT
OP CHECKPOINT COMPOSITION C E EN EJ COUNT
OP WITNESS COMPOSITION CM RM MM IM
EMIT ENTRY
EMIT CHECKPOINT
EMIT WITNESS
